  "notes": "Second column of Table 3.9a (half the adjoining-property figure). Not subject to C3.9.3 or C3.9.4. New for single houses at R40 and below (not in the table of changes). Coding excludes R100-SL: Table 2.10a removes all 3.9 provisions for R100-SL, but its footnote restores them where the development abuts a property not coded R100-SL (not encoded).",
